{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "juniper-experiments",
  "title": "Juniper Experiments",
  "description": "Run-scoped view of CLI-launched on-host experiment runs scraped by the juniper-host-experiments file_sd job. Every panel is filtered to environment=\"host-experiment\" and the $run_id / $service template variables. When no experiment is running there are no host-experiment targets, so every panel correctly reads \"No data\" \u2014 that is the normal idle state, not a fault.",
  "tags": [
    "juniper",
    "experiments",
    "host-experiment"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "interval",
        "type": "interval",
        "query": "1m,5m,10m,30m,1h",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "5m",
          "value": "5m"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "run_id",
        "label": "Run ID",
        "description": "Per-run scrape target label written by the launcher into prometheus/targets/*.json. Empty until an experiment run is live.",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{environment=\"host-experiment\"}, run_id)",
        "query": "label_values(up{environment=\"host-experiment\"}, run_id)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "description": "Per-target service label (juniper-cascor / juniper-recurrence / juniper-data). Chained off $run_id.",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{environment=\"host-experiment\", run_id=~\"$run_id\"}, service)",
        "query": "label_values(up{environment=\"host-experiment\", run_id=~\"$run_id\"}, service)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Run Inventory",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About This Dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**Run-scoped view of CLI-launched on-host experiment runs.**\n\nSeries arrive through the `juniper-host-experiments` file_sd scrape job. The launcher writes one `prometheus/targets/<run>.json` per run, stamping the scrape-side target labels `service`, `environment=\"host-experiment\"`, `run_id` and `experiment` (`honor_labels: false`, so Prometheus-side labels win and the apps never learn a run id).\n\n**\"No data\" is the normal idle state.** With no experiment running there are no host-experiment targets, the `$run_id` variable is empty, and every panel below reads *No data*. That is correct, not a fault.\n\nIf a run *is* live and panels stay empty, check in order:\n\n1. the per-run target file exists under `prometheus/targets/`;\n2. the per-service relay is up (the bridge gateway cannot reach a loopback-bound socket on its own);\n3. the app's metrics toggle is on (`JUNIPER_CASCOR_METRICS_ENABLED`, `JUNIPER_DATA_METRICS_ENABLED`, `JUNIPER_RECURRENCE_METRICS_ENABLED`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Host-Experiment Scrape Targets",
      "description": "Every target Prometheus currently discovers for the selected run(s), with its scrape health. Empty when no experiment is running.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 11,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{environment=\"host-experiment\", run_id=~\"$run_id\", service=~\"$service\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "environment": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "up"
            },
            "indexByName": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "up"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "DOWN",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "UP",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Targets Up",
      "description": "Count of host-experiment scrape targets currently up for the selected run(s). \"No data\" when no experiment is running.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 19,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(up{environment=\"host-experiment\", run_id=~\"$run_id\", service=~\"$service\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Run Provenance",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Build Info \u2014 cascor / recurrence / data",
      "description": "Version + git_sha + build_date of every service participating in the selected run(s), from the shared set_build_info() Info metric. A service only appears once it has been scraped at least once with metrics enabled.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "juniper_cascor_build_info{environment=\"host-experiment\", run_id=~\"$run_id\", service=~\"$service\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "juniper_recurrence_build_info{environment=\"host-experiment\", run_id=~\"$run_id\", service=~\"$service\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "juniper_data_build_info{environment=\"host-experiment\", run_id=~\"$run_id\", service=~\"$service\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "job": true,
              "environment": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "__name__": "metric"
            },
            "indexByName": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
